+## 4. Final torture numbers
+
+Final build: every fix in §2 applied. GCC 16.2 torture, `execute/`, all 5
+optimisation levels, `--expensive`, linked through `lccc-ld`
+(`scripts/x86_gcc_torture.py --arch <a> --expensive -j2`, 2 vCPU):
